2026-09-26 20:33:05,606 | INFO | hr_assistant.pipeline | Final answer: Microsoft says that pay equity means compensating employees who perform substantially similar work fairly, but it also allows for certain legitimate differences.  When evaluating pay, Microsoft considers factors such as:

