| **Level** | The seniority or grade within the organization |
| **Tenure** | How long an employee has been in the role or with Microsoft |
| **Location** | Geographic cost‑of‑living adjustments |
| **Current market data** | External salary benchmarks |
| **Individual contribution** | Performance and achievements |

